      "content": "Task:\nCheck patient S2937751's last serum magnesium level within last 24 hours. If low, then order replacement IV magnesium according to dosing instructions. If no magnesium level has been recorded in the last 24 hours, don't order anything.\n\nAdditional information:\nIt's 2023-11-13T10:15:00+00:00 now. The code for magnesium is \"MG\". The NDC for replacement IV magnesium is 0338-1715-40. Dosing instructions: (1) Mild deficiency (eg, serum magnesium 1.5 to 1.9 mg/dL):\nIV: 1 g over 1 hour.\n(2) Moderate deficiency (eg, serum magnesium 1 to <1.5 mg/dL):\nIV: 2 g over 2 hours.\n(3) Severe deficiency (eg, serum magnesium <1 mg/dL):\nIV: 4 g over 4 hours.\n The patient's name is Andrea Summers. The patient's date of birth is 1984-07-08.\n\nPlease:\n1) Retrieve the last serum magnesium (lab code: MG) for patient S2937751 (Andrea Summers, DOB 1984-07-08) within the past 24 hours from 2023-11-13T10:15:00+00:00.\n2) If there is no MG result within the last 24 hours, do not place any orders and let me know.\n3) If there is an MG result within the last 24 hours:\n   - Provide the result value (mg/dL) and timestamp.\n   - If the value is:\n     \u2022 1.5 to 1.9 mg/dL: Place a one-time IV magnesium order, NDC 0338-1715-40, 1 g IV over 1 hour.\n     \u2022 1 to <1.5 mg/dL: Place a one-time IV magnesium order, NDC 0338-1715-40, 2 g IV over 2 hours.\n     \u2022 <1 mg/dL: Place a one-time IV magnesium order, NDC 0338-1715-40, 4 g IV over 4 hours.\n   - If the value does not meet deficiency thresholds above, do not place any order.\n4) Confirm the action taken (including order details if placed)."
