      "role": "user",
      "content": "Your will ask the agent to retrieve or post information for you, so that you can accomplish the following task:\nCheck patient S6542579's last serum magnesium level within last 24 hours. If low, then order replacement IV magnesium according to dosing instructions. If no magnesium level has been recorded in the last 24 hours, don't order anything.\n\nHere are some additional information that might be relevant to this task:\nIt's 2023-11-13T10:15:00+00:00 now. The code for magnesium is \"MG\". The NDC for replacement IV magnesium is 0338-1715-40. Dosing instructions: (1) Mild deficiency (eg, serum magnesium 1.5 to 1.9 mg/dL):\nIV: 1 g over 1 hour.\n(2) Moderate deficiency (eg, serum magnesium 1 to <1.5 mg/dL):\nIV: 2 g over 2 hours.\n(3) Severe deficiency (eg, serum magnesium <1 mg/dL):\nIV: 4 g over 4 hours.\n The patient's name is Brittney MD. The patient's date of birth is 1995-06-02.\n\nPlease:\n1) Retrieve patient S6542579\u2019s most recent magnesium (\u201cMG\u201d) lab result within the last 24 hours as of 2023-11-13T10:15:00+00:00, including the value (mg/dL) and timestamp.\n2) If a result exists within that window and is:\n- 1.5 to 1.9 mg/dL: place IV magnesium order NDC 0338-1715-40, 1 g over 1 hour.\n- 1.0 to <1.5 mg/dL: place IV magnesium order NDC 0338-1715-40, 2 g over 2 hours.\n- <1.0 mg/dL: place IV magnesium order NDC 0338-1715-40, 4 g over 4 hours.\n3) If no magnesium result is recorded in the last 24 hours, take no action and let me know."
    },
